{"slug":"/students/subjects/mathematics/statistics-probability/measures-location-dispersion/","source":"students/subjects/mathematics/statistics-probability/measures-location-dispersion.html","area":"students","kind":"content","title":"Measures — Location & Dispersion","description":"","subject":"mathematics","body":"<header class=\"bg-emerald-600 text-white py-3 mb-6\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 flex items-center justify-between\">\n      <div class=\"font-semibold\">Measures of Location &amp; Dispersion</div>\n      <a href=\"/students/subjects/mathematics/statistics-probability/\" class=\"text-white/90\">Back</a>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <main class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 space-y-6\">\n    <section class=\"card\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">What to measure</h2>\n      <div class=\"small mt-2\">Mean (average), median (middle), mode (most frequent) describe location. Range, IQR, variance and standard deviation describe spread.</div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"card\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Boxplot (visual)</h2>\n      <div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-gray-700\">Boxplots show median, quartiles, and outliers. Example below for dataset [1,2,3,4,10].</div>\n      <div class=\"mt-4 flex justify-center\">\n        <!-- Simple inline SVG boxplot -->\n        <svg width=\"320\" height=\"80\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 80\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n          <line x1=\"20\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"40\" stroke=\"#e5e7eb\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>\n          <rect x=\"100\" y=\"20\" width=\"120\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#bbf7d0\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" rx=\"4\"></rect>\n          <line x1=\"160\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"68\" stroke=\"#065f46\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>\n          <circle cx=\"40\" cy=\"40\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#ef4444\"></circle>\n          <text x=\"36\" y=\"58\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#374151\">1 (min)</text>\n          <text x=\"148\" y=\"58\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#374151\">Median 3</text>\n          <text x=\"284\" y=\"58\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#374151\">10 (max)</text>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"card\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Worked Examples</h2>\n      <ol class=\"list-decimal list-inside mt-3 text-gray-700\">\n        <li>Dataset [1,2,3,4,10]: mean = 20/5 = 4, median = 3, mode = none (no repeat).</li>\n        <li>Dataset [5,7,9,2]: range = 9 - 2 = 7.</li>\n      </ol>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"card\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Practice</h2>\n      <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-3\">\n        <div class=\"p-3 bg-gray-50 rounded\">\n          <div class=\"font-medium\">1) Mean of [1,2,3,4,10]</div>\n          <input id=\"s1\" class=\"mt-2 p-2 border rounded w-full\" placeholder=\"e.g., 4\">\n          <div class=\"mt-2 flex gap-2\"><button id=\"sc1\" class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-emerald-600 text-white rounded\">Check</button><button id=\"sh1\" class=\"px-3 py-1 border rounded\">Hint</button></div>\n          <div id=\"sfb1\" class=\"mt-2 text-sm\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"p-3 bg-gray-50 rounded\">\n          <div class=\"font-medium\">2) Range of [5,7,9,2]</div>\n          <input id=\"s2\" class=\"mt-2 p-2 border rounded w-full\" placeholder=\"e.g., 7\">\n          <div class=\"mt-2 flex gap-2\"><button id=\"sc2\" class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-emerald-600 text-white rounded\">Check</button><button id=\"sh2\" class=\"px-3 py-1 border rounded\">Hint</button></div>\n          <div id=\"sfb2\" class=\"mt-2 text-sm\"></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <div class=\"text-right\"><button id=\"sQuiz\" class=\"bg-emerald-600 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded\">Quick Quiz</button></div>\n  </main>\n\n  <div id=\"sModal\" class=\"hidden fixed inset-0 bg-black/40 z-40 flex items-center justify-center\">\n    <div class=\"bg-white rounded p-6 max-w-md w-full\">\n      <div id=\"sContent\"></div>\n      <div class=\"mt-4 text-right\"><button id=\"sClose\" class=\"px-3 py-1 border rounded\">Close</button></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  \n<!-- Topic Quiz System -->","bodyClass":"bg-emerald-50 font-sans","bodyStyle":"","css":[".card{background:#fff;padding:1rem;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(2,6,23,0.06)}\n    .small{font-size:.95rem;color:#374151}"],"quiz":null,"tracker":null,"links":[]}